      "message": "From a user perspective, how should vnet_flow_async_range_enable() failures be handled ?\n\nI assume that if the user wants to identify which flows failed installation / attempt to re-install them, it needs to iterate using `vec_for_each(fi, flow_indices)` and verify which flows are not marked as enabled, and re-submit a new vector to vnet_flow_async_range_enable() with the flow indices that have not being enabled.\n\nMaybe we could document a recommendation for usage ?",
